        "id": 3334031
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-15T12:05:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/f85fc1bc2bc72d13dd45f97d3014bd307e481e31.camel@mediatek.com/\n \nThis is the email used to communicate with the community when using the security_cred_getsecid API. The sid is dynamically generated, and user programs cannot modify their own sid values locally.",
      "parentUuid": "b655d0f9_176020e5",
      "revId": "9c84b168942e270be4126df6f8b3c85c6249048b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
